    "title": "pandas.tseries.offsets.Week.n — pandas 3.0.5 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.tseries.offsets.Week.n#\n\n- Week.n#\n- Return the count of the number of periods. This represents how many multiples of the offset frequency should be applied. For example, `Hour(5)` has`n=5` .See also \n  - `DateOffset.normalize`\n  - Return boolean whether the frequency can align with midnight.\n Examples >>> pd.offsets.Hour(5).n 5 >>> pd.offsets.Day(3).n 3",
